## Vision image dataset — separate, non-commercial

The **images** in `data/vision/images/` are NOT released under CC-BY-4.0. They carry
**per-image licenses** recorded in per-species `sources.jsonl` sidecars:

- **iNaturalist** research-grade photos: CC-BY / CC0 / CC-BY-NC / CC-BY-SA etc. per photo —
  attribution to each photographer required; NC variants make the aggregate
  **non-commercial**.
- **DeepWeeds** (Chinee apple, Snake weed, Siam weed, negative class): CC BY 4.0.
- **GBIF** gap-fill: licenses vary per record (see sidecars).

The aggregated vision image dataset is published separately and is **non-commercial**
(CC-BY-NC-4.0) with per-image attribution sidecars. Contact the project maintainers for
commercial licensing questions.

## No warranty

All indicator claims are compiled from the cited literature. They have **not been verified
on-farm**. AUGURY provides indicators only — never management or remediation advice.
